# Changes to these paths need the owner's review before they merge; everything
# else can merge on green CI plus the reviewer agent's `nest/review` check.
# They are the paths whose changes could weaken nest's guardrails or the gates
# on this repo. See dev/github.md.

# The gates themselves: CI and its configs, deploys, this file, agent instructions and skills.
/.github/                                   @by77er
/CLAUDE.md                                  @by77er
/.claude/                                   @by77er
/scripts/                                   @by77er
/rust-toolchain.toml                        @by77er
/clippy.toml                                @by77er
/deny.toml                                  @by77er
/.gitleaks.toml                             @by77er

# Dependencies (supply chain).
